DESCRIPTION=("Embedding: one-hot token + position. Layer 0 scores each key j for query p by e[p].A0.e[j], softmaxes, "
 "and adds the values e[j].P0: every position holds a soft summary of the map f around it. Layer 1 reads only position "
 "5, scores keys by r0[5].A1.r0[j], mixes the values into v1, and the output is r0[5].W_U+v1.(P1.W_U)=the logits.")
